        {
          "text": "Kwasuka isithunywa seNkosi, sabulala amaAsiriya azinkulungwane ezilikhulu lamatshumi aficaminwembili lanhlanu ezihonqweni zawo. Kwathi abantu bevuka ekuseni kakhulu babona bonke laba sebeyizidumbu kuphela. ",
