        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho ekhonza endlini kaNisiroki unkulunkulu wakhe, oAdrameleki loSharezeri amadodana akhe bambulala ngomkhonto, babalekela elizweni laseArarati. UEsarihadoni indodana yakhe waba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.",
